From 2a7197cd5fe73fdafd560440bf61f4f9ac636772 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yibo Wang <2024312277@stu.hit.edu.cn>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 05:22:06 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: camera bring-up: iceland DT wiring + sc1300cs probe
 driver

- kaanapali.dtsi: qcom,kaanapali-camss node (v14 single-node topology,
  from binding example; disabled by default)
- iceland: &camss enable + 12 csiphy supplies (l3d_0p8/l1d_1p2 per MTP
  reference), ports 4/5 endpoints, i2c9 enable, rear camera@36 / front
  camera@10 SmartSens sensor nodes, PMK8850 func2 MCLK + PMH0110-G
  reset pinctrl states
- drivers/media/i2c/sc1300cs.c: power-on sequence + chip-ID read
  (0x3107: 0xc658 rear / 0xd154 front), no register tables yet
- binding: smartsens,sc1300cs.yaml

Note: hot-test artifacts (i2c9-only dtb + configfs overlay) live in
/home/wyb/Documents/mainline/camera/, outside this tree.
---
