+config VIDEO_SC1300CS
+	tristate "SmartSens SC1300CS / SC820CS sensor bring-up support"
+	select V4L2_CCI_I2C
+	help
+	  This is a Video4Linux2 sensor driver for the SmartSens SC1300CS
+	  (13 MP) and SC820CS (8 MP) camera sensors found on the OnePlus
+	  Pad 4.  It implements the power-on sequence and chip-ID check
+	  only; streaming requires register tables that are not available
+	  yet.
+
+	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
+	  module will be called sc1300cs.
+
